# ── secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The filled-in setup script carries a live Cloudflare tunnel token (a
# credential — anyone holding it can run a connector for the tunnel). Only the
# .example template is tracked; copy it and fill the token locally.
ops/laptop-setup/setup-access.ps1
secrets.env
*.pem
*.key
id_ed25519*

# ── runtime state (lives on George's laptop, never in the repo) ──────────────
raw/
work/
index/
state/
logs/
gateway/run/
gateway/uploads/
bot/uploads/
bot/.progress

# ── deps / build ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
package-lock.json
__pycache__/
*.pyc
